{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":43,"name":"Fransina Stradling","username":"f.stradling","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/discourse.igelsociety.org/f.stradling/{size}/9_2.png","created_at":"2021-10-12T16:53:28.170Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI am pleased to share the schedule for the Autumn 2021 Linguistics Research Seminars hosted by the University of Huddersfield Linguistics and Modern Languages department.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll seminars take place on Wednesdays and are scheduled to start at 15.30 BST/GMT. Talks typically last between 30 and 50 minutes and are followed by 10 to 15 minutes of discussion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeminars will take place virtually via Zoom. You will need to register for each seminar separately to receive a Zoom link for the event, which you will receive the day before the seminar takes place. Registration links for each seminar can be found \u003ca href=\"https://www.linguisticsathuddersfield.com/research-seminars\"\u003ehere.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll welcome!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more information contact Dan McIntyre at \u003cspan class=\"email-redacted\"\u003e[email redacted]\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"//discourse.igelsociety.org/uploads/default/original/1X/8db77a25b96fb6a0f64ac4bd7940bf63517440f9.png\" data-download-href=\"//discourse.igelsociety.org/uploads/default/8db77a25b96fb6a0f64ac4bd7940bf63517440f9\" title=\"Linguistics at Huddersfield seminar series autumn 2021\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//discourse.igelsociety.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8db77a25b96fb6a0f64ac4bd7940bf63517440f9_2_345x500.png\" alt=\"Linguistics at Huddersfield seminar series autumn 2021\" data-base62-sha1=\"kdGq7qUYjUqqIlN3zc2qoSMMDUd\" width=\"345\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"//discourse.igelsociety.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8db77a25b96fb6a0f64ac4bd7940bf63517440f9_2_345x500.png, //discourse.igelsociety.org/uploads/